      "text": "WHAT MAKES CLASSIFICATION DIFFERENT FROM REGRESSION WHEN\nYOU ARE INTERRPRETING NUMBERS? \n- classification predict a small finite limited set of possible output categories \nsuch as 0,1 and 2 but not all possible numbers in between like 0.5 or 1.7",
