      "updated": 1787605049795,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-production code lives in src/ not in notebooks\n-pytest can automatically discover these tests\n-configurations should be separate from code\n-notebooks are for (exploration, experimentation, visualization, research)\n-docker file defines how to build the environment where yout app runs\n-pyproject.toml: the central configuration file for the python project\n-editable installation so while developing changes to the source code are\nreflected without\nneeding to reinstall the packages every time\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-production code lives in src/ not in notebooks\n-pytest can automatically discover these tests\n-configurations should be separate from code\n-notebooks are for (exploration, experimentation, visualization, research)\n-docker file defines how to build the environment where yout app runs\n-pyproject.toml: the central configuration file for the python project\n-editable installation so while developing changes to the source code are reflected without\nneeding to reinstall the packages every time\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
